/**
 * component-curation.ts — the editorial layer over the component scan.
 *
 * `component-data.json` (generated by aartiq-browser/scripts/component-scanner.js)
 * is the source of truth for which components exist, their line counts and their
 * tags. This file only holds what the scanner cannot know:
 *
 *   - desktopMembership / flutterMembership: the curated category a scanned
 *     component is listed under. Scanned components without an entry here fall
 *     back to their scanner group's default category in page.tsx.
 *   - serviceOrder: display order for the background-service tab.
 *   - curatedDescriptions: hand-written blurbs that replace the scanner's
 *     filename-derived guess.
 *
 * Curating a newly scanned component: append its file name to the right category
 * array (and optionally add a description below). Files missing from the scan
 * never render, whatever this file says.
 */

